cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CTL AEO-500 — 500 Cited AEO Questions on Black Culture"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: "500 answer-engine question units on Black culture — each with a primary question, a cited direct answer (31-55 words), a 5-question cluster, keywords, a Wikidata QID or an honest NONE marker, and a dated verification note (2026-11-04). Assembled from the verified KG333 (333) and FC300 (167) registries. Citation statuses are the dataset's evidence vocabulary: 321 rows rest on Wikipedia/Wikidata, 88 fictional characters carry franchise coverage only, and 11 rows are GAPs where CultureTechLens is the source of record and no external page exists."
authors:
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
